<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Offer Letter — {{ role_title }}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f7fa; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 680px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29, #302b63, #24243e); padding: 40px 48px; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 40px 48px; }
    .section { margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .section h2 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #6c63ff; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .kv-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; padding: 10px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .kv-row .label { color: #666; }
    .kv-row .value { font-weight: 600; }
    .highlight-box { background: #f0eeff; border-left: 4px solid #6c63ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .highlight-box .amount { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: #302b63; }
    .highlight-box .sub { font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-top: 4px; }
    .contract-html { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; }
    .footer { background: #f5f7fa; padding: 24px 48px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #999; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Congratulations! 🎉</h1>
      <p>We're thrilled to extend this offer for the <strong>{{ role_title }}</strong> position.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <div class="section">
        <h2>Position Details</h2>
        <div class="kv-row"><span class="label">Role</span><span class="value">{{ role_title }}</span></div>
        <div class="kv-row"><span class="label">Start Date</span><span class="value">{{ start_date }}</span></div>
        <div class="kv-row"><span class="label">Status</span><span class="value"><span class="badge">Pending Signature</span></span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="highlight-box">
        <div class="amount">Review Your Offer</div>
        <div class="sub">Your complete employment agreement, compensation breakdown, and leave entitlements are included below.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Employment Agreement</h2>
        <div class="contract-html">
          {{ offer_letter_html | safe }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      This document was generated by the Enterprise Onboarding System. Please do not reply to this email.
      For questions, contact your HR representative directly.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
